{"id": "94", "question": "How many buttons are on the jacket of the person at the forefront of the image?", "gt": "There are three buttons on the jacket of the person at the forefront of the image.", "pred": "The jacket of the person at the forefront of the image has six buttons.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The jacket of the person at the forefront of the image has six buttons.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. Identify the jacket in the image: The jacket is located in the lower right section of the image, with a blurred background.\n2. Look for buttons on the jacket: The jacket has a series of vertical lines that appear to be buttons, aligned in a row.\n3. Count the buttons: There are six visible buttons aligned vertically on the jacket.\nThe next logical reasoning step is:\nGiven the visible details, the person in the image is wearing a jacket with six buttons on the front. No other buttons or objects are visible on the jacket.\n\nThe jacket of the person at the forefront of the image has six buttons.", "time_sec": 12.524, "generation_time_seconds": 11.9445, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0263, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 26208, 304, 279, 2168, 25, 576, 1697, 518, 279, 51201, 374, 12233, 264, 26208, 448, 264, 9434, 4065, 624, 17, 13, 95210, 279, 12424, 25, 25806, 389, 279, 4065, 315, 279, 26208, 1380, 12424, 525, 11136, 7407, 624, 18, 13, 4504, 279, 12424, 25, 10627, 3641, 1760, 1817, 3137, 9434, 389, 279, 26208, 594, 4065, 382, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.1336, -0.0, -0.2709, -0.0, -2.2064, -0.6623, -0.0126, -0.0646, -1.5152, -0.1242, -2.1795, -0.1454, -0.0, -0.0, -0.3915, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0134, -0.8125, -0.1007, -0.3422, -0.0691, -0.2436, -0.0,