{"id": "96", "question": "What is the lion wearing on its face?", "gt": "The lion is wearing a pair of glasses.", "pred": "The lion is not wearing anything on its face.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The lion is not wearing anything on its face.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. The image consists of a pattern of abstract designs that resemble animal fur or skin textures.\n2. These designs include various shades and patterns that mimic the appearance of a lion's fur.\n3. The lion's facial features, such as eyes, nose, and mouth, are not distinctly visible in the abstract patterns; they are integrated into the overall texture design.\n4. There are no visible accessories or additional objects on the lion's face within the image. The patterns themselves represent the lion's natural appearance without any adornments.\nThe next logical reasoning step would be:\nGiven the abstract nature of the image and the absence of distinct facial features or any accessories, it is reasonable to conclude that the lion is not wearing anything on its face, as the image does not depict any such elements.\n\nThe lion is not wearing anything on its face.", "time_sec": 15.17, "generation_time_seconds": 14.5762, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1177, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 785, 32711, 7354, 525, 24391, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 15