{"id": "105", "question": "How many pairs of sunglasses are visible in the image?", "gt": "There are three visible pairs of sunglasses in the image.", "pred": "There are two pairs of sunglasses visible in the image.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "There are two pairs of sunglasses visible in the image.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. The image consists of a collage of various objects.\n2. Among the objects, there are items that resemble sunglasses.\n3. Sunglasses are typically characterized by two lenses connected by a bridge.\n4. In the image, there are objects that appear to have two lenses and a bridge-like structure.\n5. Counting these objects, there are two pairs of sunglasses visible in the image.\nThe next logical step is to describe the details of the sunglasses visible in the image. This would involve noting the color, style, and any distinctive features of each pair of sunglasses. However, since the task is to focus on factual analysis based on the image provided, and the details are not explicitly asked for in the question, the analysis stops here.\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\nThere are two pairs of sunglasses visible in the image.", "time_sec": 14.371, "generation_time_seconds": 13.8297, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0696, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 6171, 304, 279, 2168, 25, 576, 2168, 17167, 315, 5248, 77357, 24248, 11, 1045, 315, 892, 4994, 311, 42404, 13702, 323, 42463, 3565, 624, 17, 13, 9192, 369, 59369, 25, 25806, 389, 24588, 894, 6171, 429, 51180, 59369, 2878, 279, 24248, 624, 18, 13, 4504, 279, 13530, 25, 9646, 10820, 11, 1760, 279, 1372, 315, 12460, 13530, 315, 59369, 9434, 304, 279, 2168, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645], "logp_list": [0.0, -0.137, -0.0, -0.6859, -0.