{"id": "122", "question": "Is the bed a queen size or king size?", "gt": "There is no bed; No bed is visible in the picture; There is no bed present", "pred": "The bed is a queen size.", "group_key": "false premises", "sub_category": "false premises", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The bed is a queen size.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n1. The image shows a collage of various close-up and partial views of a bed.\n2. The visible parts of the bed include the mattress, headboard, and some bedding.\n3. The details of the bed are consistent with a standard double or queen-sized bed, as there are no indications of a larger king-sized bed such as a wider headboard or larger mattress size.\n4. The headboard appears to be of a typical height and design for a queen-sized bed, without the additional width that would be expected for a king-sized bed.\n5. The mattress also appears to be standard in size, without the extended length\nGiven the details observed, the bed appears to be a queen size, as there are no clear indicators of a king-sized bed such as a wider headboard or larger mattress size. The headboard and mattress dimensions align more closely with a standard queen-sized bed.\nThe final answer is that the bed is a queen size.\n\nThe bed is a queen size.", "time_sec": 15.365, "generation_time_seconds": 14.8393, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0292, "record_process": true, "stages": [{"step": 0, "phase": "rollout", "rollouts": [{"beam": 0, "rollout": 0, "token_ids": [198, 16, 13, 4657, 13267, 279, 15336, 315, 279, 4845, 304, 279, 2168, 624, 17, 13, 23768, 279, 13166, 15336, 311, 5297, 27906, 323, 11477, 4845, 12282, 624, 18, 13, 29901, 279, 1379, 3118, 389, 279, 8674, 48792, 13, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 151645, 1